  {
   "id": "dark-farts-parody-smell-edition-383045@1.2",
   "gameId": "dark-farts-parody-smell-edition-383045",
   "displayName": "PATCH 1.2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-21T12:45:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You reported the bugs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We gave the developers coffee instead of beer.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Apparently that works. ☕💀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Patch 1.2 is here with fixes based directly on your reports!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "💾 LEVEL 7 NOW REMEMBERS YOUR SUFFERING",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Died in Level 7?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Previously: CONGRATULATIONS! DO THE WHOLE FUCKING THING AGAIN. 💀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now we've added checkpoints throughout Level 7.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Boss retries also bring you back to the fight without replaying the introduction, and completed conversations stay completed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Less repetition. Same EMOTIONAL DAMAGE.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🔧 WE ALSO FIXED SOME QUESTIONABLE SHIT",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "⚔️ Boss health bars now show the correct boss names instead of apparently believing everyone is Bez-Off.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🗣️ Fixed the broken Talk prompt on the first Level 7 villager. He has finally decided to communicate.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🚪 Fixed the entrance to Meta-Morph's arena. You may now enter through the door like a normal human being instead of discovering the sacred three-pixel entrance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "👻 Fixed the invisible collision near the Level 6 boss stairs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Turns out the invisible wall was not a secret boss mechanic.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "❤️ THANK YOU!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "These fixes came directly from your bug reports.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You find them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We panic.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We fix them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Then we pretend everything was under control. 🍺",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Keep the reports coming!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We play. We listen. We fix. We don't judge.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "💨 PATCH 1.2 — LIVE NOW",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fewer bugs. Better checkpoints. Same stupid developers. 🔧🫘💨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
