  {
   "id": "dark-farts-parody-smell-edition-383045@1.1",
   "gameId": "dark-farts-parody-smell-edition-383045",
   "displayName": "PATCH 1.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-18T13:38:07.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "💨 PATCH 1.1 IS LIVE!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You complained. We listened.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The developers stopped drinking for approximately 17 minutes and somehow made our biggest update yet. 🍺🔧",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎮 CONTROLLER SUPPORT",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Controller support has been expanded across gameplay, dialogue, menus, settings and confirmation screens.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "And yes... FARTS ARE NOW ON THE D-PAD",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "⬅️ Green Fart",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⬆️ Fire Fart",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "➡️ Ice Fart",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⬇️ Final Fart",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Humanity has peaked. 💨🏆",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam Input now also provides appropriate button prompts for Xbox, PlayStation, Nintendo, Steam Controller and Steam Deck layouts.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "pc",
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "⌨️ CUSTOM CONTROLS",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You asked. We finally did it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now fully rebind keyboard/mouse AND controller controls from:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Settings → Key bindings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Custom bindings are saved, conflicts can be detected and swapped, and you can restore the defaults whenever your cursed control experiment goes too far.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🏆 ACHIEVEMENTS FIXED",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You farted.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam said you didn't.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "THIS INJUSTICE ENDS TODAY. 💀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've fixed the missing Steam achievement integration, including tracking for My First Fart, Fart Hero, and chapter-completion achievements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Your farting can finally become part of recorded history. 🏆💨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🔧 AND MORE FIXES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We've also improved controller menu navigation, button prompts, video/settings navigation and confirmation dialogs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Several crashes have been fixed, including an intermittent startup crash involving AMD FSR + NVIDIA frame generation and a gameplay crash involving input-button icons.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "And most importantly...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "THE CARDBOARD BOXES IN LEVEL 3 HAVE THEIR CORRECT MATERIALS AGAIN. 📦",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "You're welcome.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "❤️ THANK YOU!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A lot of Patch 1.1 came directly from your reviews, discussions and bug reports.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You reported it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We worked on it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And we're not finished.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Keep sending us feedback and bugs at",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "support@violarte.net",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": ".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We play. We listen. We fix. We don't judge.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "💨 PATCH 1.1 — LIVE NOW",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Less technical damage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More EMOTIONAL DAMAGE. 🎮💀💨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
